go test ./internal/cli/...` (full package) \u2014 passed\\n- `go vet ./internal/cli/...` \u2014 clean\\n\\nNo test files, `go.mod`, or `go.sum` were modified.\",\"ttft_ms\":2112,\"ttft_stream_ms\":1465,\"time_to_request_ms\":23,\"type\":\"result\",\"duration_ms\":191873,\"uuid\":\"d254a535-fd95-4b93-8e40-bdd4671b23e4\"}\n",
